                <ITEXT FONT="Public Sans Regular" FONTSIZE="9" FCOLOR="Text-Base-Dark" CH="Graduated from the University of Santiago de Cali (November 2021). Participated in university-sponsored robotics and programming events, working on low-level robotic programming and coding challenges. My contributions later inspired projects in machine learning for differential equations and computer vision for biometric access control."/>
